  "packageHash": "FbGNhaX+AEyrN05aRScIOz1ZgK2qHtza7sMWxMBzqkssyrBYwPajqBWCrXUMMdQKsreeTMzgqPmOA0mHf0jA1g==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 107525,
  "published": "2026-09-03T18:21:36.773Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since version 10.0.0\n\nAdded:\n- [L10NSharp] Added pseudolocalization support: lookups for the standard `qps-ploc` pseudo-locale (`LocalizationManager.PseudoLocalizationLanguageId`) return the English text pseudolocalized at runtime (e.g. `[Tîitlée Mîissîing]`), so testers can spot non-internationalized strings and layout problems. Set `LocalizationManager.OfferPseudoLocalization = true` to include it in the offered UI languages; `LocalizationManager.PseudoLocalize(string)` exposes the transform directly. The SampleApp turns this on, so you can see it in action. See `src/L10NSharp/Pseudo/README.md`.\n\nSee full changelog at https://github.com/sillsdev/l10nsharp/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
